<title>FINLAND: TABLE - SILJA SINKS TO FIM 144 MLN H1 LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SILJA SINKS TO FIM 144 MLN H1 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997,</p>
<p>				     (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items		     144 vs 127 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,635 vs 1,760</p>
<p> Operating loss					33 vs 1 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Eight analysts' median forecast for Finnish passenger</p>
<p>ferry operator Silja Oy Ab's loss after financial items had been</p>
<p>86.5 million markka in a 126 - 53.8 million range (all losses).</p>
<p> Operating contribution			   102 vs 133</p>
<p> Depreciation					 135 vs 134</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 111 vs 126 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						    1 vs nil</p>
<p> Net loss					     145 vs 127</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Silja Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
